    "question1": "At what age can you play football golf?",
    "question2": "What do I need to bring to football golf?",
    "question3": "How long is the waiting time at the holes?",
    "question4": "How long does a round of football golf take?",
    "question5": "Do I need previous knowledge of football golf?",
    "question6": "Is a reservation possible?",
    "question7": "What will we do with our reservation if the weather forecast is bad?",
    "question8": "Is it necessary to split a larger group into several small groups?",
    "question9": "Can I bring food or drinks to the facility?",
    "question10": "Do I have to change clothes or wear special clothes?",
    "question11": "How do I get the latest dates and news about the soccer park and football golf?",
    "question12": "Are dogs allowed?",
    "question13": "Are there also gift vouchers?",
    "question14": "Are celebrations and events possible?",
    
    "answer1": "Football golf can be played from the age of 6 to old age.",
    "answer2": "Good mood and sports shoes (attention: no knobs or cleated shoes). You can borrow the balls for a deposit - you are also welcome to bring your own balls!",
    "answer3": "Waiting times are possible. The sporting rule that larger groups let smaller groups overtake applies!",
    "answer4": "An average player needs about 2 hours for 18 holes.",
    "answer5": "No. You will receive a briefing from us at the start, during which all questions will be answered.",
    "answer6": "Reservations are required for bachelor parties and groups of 10 or more people! This way we can plan better and arrange a suitable date or start time with you.",
    "answer7": "If the weather forecast predicts only light rain, football golf is not a problem. We only ask that you call us if there is a reliable bad weather forecast or severe weather warning.",
    "answer8": "Yes. A group consists of a maximum of 5 people who can start at different holes at the same time (cannon start). A cannon start is the mode where all participants in a game round start at the same time but on different holes - this avoids unnecessary waiting times!",
    "answer9": "It is not allowed to bring your own food and drinks to the facility. At the kiosk you can get drinks, ice cream and snacks, which you can take with you.",
    "answer10": "No, you can play with normal athletic clothing. Shoe cleaning possible!",
    "answer11": "We recommend that you regularly visit our constantly updated Facebook page.",
    "answer12": "No, dogs are not allowed on the football golf course. At the kiosk they are only allowed to wait on a leash.",
    "answer13": "Yes, at the cash desk or on the website.",
    "answer14": "You have all the options at our facility! It is best to contact us in good time so that we can take your special wishes into account when planning. We are happy to discuss special requests for your event.",

